<title>USA: Interstate/Johnson renews buyback plan.</title>
<headline>Interstate/Johnson renews buyback plan.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interstate/Johnson Lane Inc said on Tuesday it renewed authorization for the repurchase of up to one million shares as part of its ongoing share repurchase program.</p>
<p>The company said it has purchased 246,000 shares during the past 12 months.</p>
<p>Interstate/Johnson was trading at 17-3/4 on Tuesday, up 5/8 on the day.</p>
